{
  "version": "2.11",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "edges-root",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Mars DS — Dependency graph: edges (slice 2/6)",
      "width": 1440,
      "fill": "$bg-light",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 48,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [

        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "edges-hdr",
          "name": "Artboard Header",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "edges-hdr-t",
              "name": "title",
              "fill": "$mars-night",
              "content": "Edge visual language — dependency graph",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "edges-hdr-s",
              "name": "sub",
              "fill": "$muted-light",
              "content": "Two edge kinds: solid ($mars-night, originId-parent lineage) and dashed ($mars-rust, blocker / waiting-on). Three label variants: slice index+title on an idea→task edge, failure signature on a task→fix-task edge, blocker reason on a blocker edge.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "edges-hdr-r",
              "name": "rule",
              "fill": "$muted-light",
              "content": "Stroke style (solid vs dashed) is the primary distinguisher; hue ($mars-night vs $mars-rust) is a second, reinforcing signal. Labels sit centered on the edge midpoint — 11px Inter, $muted-light, italic — and never overlap with node bounds.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },

        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "sec1",
          "name": "Section 1 — Edge kinds (solid vs dashed)",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "sec1-hdr",
              "name": "sectionHeader",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sec1-hdr-t",
                  "name": "sectionTitle",
                  "fill": "$mars-night",
                  "content": "1. Edge kinds",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sec1-hdr-s",
                  "name": "sectionSub",
                  "fill": "$muted-light",
                  "content": "Solid = lineage (why this task exists — its originId-parent chain). Dashed = blocker (what this task is waiting on). Both carry a directional arrowhead pointing toward the dependency.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "sec1-row",
              "name": "specimensRow",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "horizontal",
              "gap": 32,
              "alignItems": "start",
              "children": [

                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "mockA",
                  "name": "Mock A — solid originId-parent edge",
                  "width": 656,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "mockA-cap",
                      "name": "caption",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 2,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "mockA-cap-t",
                          "name": "captionTitle",
                          "fill": "$mars-night",
                          "content": "A. Solid edge — originId-parent (lineage)",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "mockA-cap-s",
                          "name": "captionSub",
                          "fill": "$muted-light",
                          "content": "Drawn for every originId relationship: idea → task, task → fix-task, proposal slice promotions. Read: 'the right-hand node gave rise to the left-hand node.'",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "mockA-canvas",
                      "name": "canvas",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "fill": "$surface-light",
                      "cornerRadius": 8,
                      "stroke": { "align": "inside", "thickness": 1, "fill": "$border-light" },
                      "padding": 32,
                      "layout": "horizontal",
                      "gap": 0,
                      "alignItems": "center",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "mockA-from",
                          "name": "fromNode — child task",
                          "fill": "$surface-light",
                          "cornerRadius": 6,
                          "stroke": { "align": "inside", "thickness": 1, "fill": "$border-light" },
                          "padding": [8, 12],
                          "layout": "horizontal",
                          "gap": 6,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "mockA-from-dot",
                              "name": "statusDot — in-flight",
                              "width": 8,
                              "height": 8,
                              "cornerRadius": 4,
                              "fill": "$mars-ochre"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "mockA-from-id",
                              "name": "taskId",
                              "fill": "$mars-night",
                              "content": "mars-9b021ddc",
                              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                              "fontSize": 11,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "mockA-edge",
                          "name": "solidEdge",
                          "layout": "horizontal",
                          "gap": 0,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "mockA-edge-line",
                              "name": "solidLine",
                              "width": 220,
                              "height": 2,
                              "fill": "$mars-night"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "mockA-edge-arrow",
                              "name": "arrowhead",
                              "fill": "$mars-night",
                              "content": "▶",
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 10,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "mockA-to",
                          "name": "toNode — parent task",
                          "fill": "$surface-light",
                          "cornerRadius": 6,
                          "stroke": { "align": "inside", "thickness": 1, "fill": "$border-light" },
                          "padding": [8, 12],
                          "layout": "horizontal",
                          "gap": 6,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "mockA-to-dot",
                              "name": "statusDot — done",
                              "width": 8,
                              "height": 8,
                              "cornerRadius": 4,
                              "fill": "$mars-green"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "mockA-to-id",
                              "name": "taskId",
                              "fill": "$mars-night",
                              "content": "mars-7af3c2e1",
                              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                              "fontSize": 11,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mockA-note",
                      "name": "specNote",
                      "fill": "$muted-light",
                      "content": "SVG: stroke=$mars-night, stroke-width=2, stroke-dasharray=none. Arrowhead: marker-end triangle, filled $mars-night. Direction: child → parent (walking backward up the lineage).",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },

                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "mockB",
                  "name": "Mock B — dashed blocker edge",
                  "width": 656,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "mockB-cap",
                      "name": "caption",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 2,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "mockB-cap-t",
                          "name": "captionTitle",
                          "fill": "$mars-night",
                          "content": "B. Dashed edge — blocker (waiting-on)",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "mockB-cap-s",
                          "name": "captionSub",
                          "fill": "$muted-light",
                          "content": "Drawn for every task_blockers relationship. Read: 'the left-hand node cannot dispatch until the right-hand node reaches done.' Uses $mars-rust to reinforce the 'impediment' semantic.",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "mockB-canvas",
